       `S_k = product_p alpha_p(k) / (1 - 1/p)^{2^k},`
       `alpha_p(k) = #{(x, h_1, ..., h_k) in (Z/p)^{k+1} : x + epsilon . h != 0 for all epsilon in {0,1}^k} / p^{k+1}`.
    
