       restricted to k_max ≤ 5 nonzero bottom-layer weights).
    4. Random-matched controls at N=4 (10 seeds) and N=6 (10 seeds).
    5. Single-bit predictor accuracy for PRIMES vs random matched (30 seeds)
       at N=4..8.
    
