    27	indicator's normalized U^2 norm collapses to within 0.1% of 1, exactly
    28	matching the HL prediction `S^(W)_2 -> 1` as `W -> infinity`. This is
    29	the chi_P-analog of the Green-Tao W-trick result for the von Mangoldt
    30	function Lambda.
