 / PPP / signed-real-K / complex-Hermitian-K point process. FOURTH INDEPENDENT CONFIRMATION (after E2.13/S85 Gowers, E2.14/S88 Anderson, E2.15/S92 algebraic immunity) that chi_P structure = HL equidistribution mod q, now in a FOURTH orthogonal mathematical category (point-process theory) AND at the 3-point level (prior three were 2-point). **Closure mode I**: HL prime-by-prime factorisation cannot reduce to pair-level kernel. Cross-domain ingredient (DPP) performed real work; first project use. Cites E2.13, E2.14, E2.15, E1.10, E3.13, E7.1. Cross-domain refs: Hough-Krishnapur-Peres-Virag 2009 *Zeros of GAFs and DPPs* (AMS ULect 51); Soshnikov 2000 (arXiv:math/0002099); Vere-Jones 1997 alpha-DPP. See experiments/constructions/primes_dpp_ppp_fit/primes_dpp_ppp_fit_results.md. | 95 |
