Construction: pick a prime `p ∈ (2^(d-1), 2·2^(d-1)]`, use σ = `(column 1, column p − 2^(d-1) − 1)`. The 2×2 submatrix is upper-triangular `[[1, ?], [0, 1]]` because `2^(d-1) + 2` is even and >2, hence not prime. `det = 1`. `#print axioms` shows only `[propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]`.

