    681	### E2.13 — Gowers U^k norm of chi_P matches Hardy-Littlewood {0,1}^k-cube singular series; universal across log-weighting (chi_P, Λ)  [EVS M]
    682	
    683	S85, refined S93; ATTACK_VECTORS §D6, NOVELTY_CHALLENGES §D6.b;
