now in a FIFTH orthogonal mathematical category (algebraic-topological / metric-space geometry). **Closure mode I**: PH is a measurement instrument, not an algorithm — no closed-form polylog evaluator suggested; VR-PH costs O(M^3) worst-case. Cross-domain ingredient (PH on Takens embedding via ripser) performed real work; first project quantitative measurement (S10 mention was qualitative, gtda-based, no baseline). Cites E2.13, E2.14, E2.15, E2.16, E7.7. Cross-domain refs: Carlsson 2009 BAMS 46(2); Edelsbrunner-Harer 2010 *Computational Topology*; Bauer 2021 J. Appl. Comput. Topol. 5 (arXiv:1908.02518); Cohen-Steiner-Edelsbrunner-Harer 2007 (PH stability). See experiments/topological/persistent_homology_chi_p/persistent_homology_chi_p_results.md. | 96 |
