    809	
    810	Define the discrete 1D Schrödinger operator
    811	`H psi(n) = -psi(n+1) - psi(n-1) + V(n) psi(n)`, transfer matrix
    812	`T_n(E) = [[V(n) - E, -1], [1, 0]] in SL(2, R)`, and Lyapunov exponent
    813	`gamma(E) = lim_N (1/N) log ||T_N ... T_1||`. For sparse `V in {0, 1}`
    814	at density `rho` Pastur-Figotin gives `gamma(E) ~ rho(1-rho)/(8 sin^2(k))`
    815	inside the band `E = -2 cos(k) in (-2, 2)`.
    816	
    817	Empirically (`N = 10^5`, 50 random seeds, 51 energies):
    818	
    819	   Baseline (Bernoulli at matched density rho = pi(N)/N):
    820	       max |z|(gamma_prime - gamma_bern) = 88.5 sigma at E = 0.108
    821	
    822	The deviation reduces monotonically when the random control sieves
    823	out small-modulus residue classes (W-trick):
    824	
    825	   W = 2  (parity matched)         max |z| = 32.7   at E = 1.088
    826	   W = 6  (mod 2, 3 matched)       max |z| = 11.9   at E = 0.010 (N=2*10^5)
