    10	    D(x) = -(log x / sqrt(x)) * sum_rho Li(x^rho) - log(2) log(x)/sqrt(x) + ...
    11	        ~ -2 sum_{gamma>0} cos(gamma * log x - arctan(2 gamma)) / sqrt(1/4 + gamma^2)
